{"id":67369,"date":"2025-09-24T07:42:31","date_gmt":"2025-09-24T06:42:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67369"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:12:20","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:12:20","slug":"sao-silvestre-batalha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-batalha\/","title":{"rendered":"13\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre da Batalha 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">13\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre da Batalha 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">13\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre da Batalha 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica vila da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Batalha<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Leiria<\/strong>. Com centro log\u00edstico, partida e meta na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Rua das Piscinas<\/strong>, junto ao <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos da Batalha<\/strong>, o evento arranca \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">14:30<\/strong> com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Jovem<\/strong>, seguindo-se o tiro de partida da corrida principal de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km \u00e0s 17:00<\/strong> e da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 17:15<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Correr na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Batalha<\/strong> ao cair da noite de dezembro proporciona um enquadramento monumental \u00edmpar, num percurso urbano iluminado pelas decora\u00e7\u00f5es natal\u00edcias e dominado pela impon\u00eancia g\u00f3tica e manuelina do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mosteiro de Santa Maria da Vit\u00f3ria (Mosteiro da Batalha)<\/strong>, Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO. Al\u00e9m dos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km competitivos<\/strong> e dos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">5 km de caminhada<\/strong>, os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (Sub-10 a Sub-18 e Prova Extra) disputam dist\u00e2ncias entre <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">100 m e 2.000 m<\/strong> durante a tarde.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Atl\u00e9tico Clube Batalha<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal da Batalha<\/strong> e com o apoio t\u00e9cnico da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria (ADAL)<\/strong>, a prova oferece pe\u00e7a de vestu\u00e1rio alusiva ao evento, saco de lembran\u00e7as, dorsal personalizado, banhos no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Complexo Desportivo da Batalha<\/strong> e uma campanha especial para equipas (1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita por cada 10 inscritos nos 10 km). Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; d